Extends REQ-ARC-WMTE-5725 with 3 operator-requested changes: 16384 budget (2x),
N=20 (full usable ceiling of 25 public games; 5 lack a seeded window), dual-GPU
ThinkingCap serving topology (empirically smoke-selected).

Result: ThinkingCap induce_ok 31/40 (77.5%) vs Qwen3.5-9B-MTP 6/40 (15%) at 16384;
paired by game N=20, Wilcoxon signed-rank p=0.0005 (well-powered, resolves 5725's
